AirPlay Receiver (glass) is a fork of Shield AirPlay (https://github.com/ebreen/shield-airplay), GPL v3, which is derived
from android-airplay-server by jqssun (https://github.com/jqssun/android-airplay-server) and uses UxPlay
(https://github.com/FDH2/UxPlay). The full commit history of those authors is preserved in this repository.

Bundled fonts and images:

- Outfit font (app/src/main/res/font/outfit.ttf): SIL Open Font License 1.1, copy in licenses/Outfit-OFL.txt.
- Two blurred background photos (app/src/main/res/drawable-nodpi/glass_bg_*.jpg) made from Unsplash photos, used under
  the Unsplash licence (https://unsplash.com/license). The photographers of the set they were chosen from are Thomas
  Griesbeck, Niklas Jonasson, Linus Nylund, Atsadawut Chaiseeha, raouf bedrani and MagicPattern.

